{'symbol': 'DVA', 'date': '2021-05-13 06:02:00', 'title': 'EXTRAORDINARY NURSES AT DAVITA KIDNEY CARE HONORED WITH DAISY AWARDS', 'text': "DENVER, MAY 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 DAVITA KIDNEY CARE TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT 60 OF ITS NEPHROLOGY NURSES WERE HONORED WITH THE DAISY AWARD FOR EXTRAORDINARY NURSES® DURING NATIONAL NURSES WEEK. THE AWARD IS PART OF THE DAISY FOUNDATION'S MISSION TO RECOGNIZE THE EXTRAORDINARY, COMPASSIONATE CARE THAT NURSES PROVIDE TO PATIENTS AND FAMILIES EVERY DAY."}